+C
+C   NHCO HOLDS 120 ENTRIES, WHICH IS TWO PER AMIDE N-H, SO 60 GROUPS.
+C   THE LOOP ABOVE HAD NO BOUND CHECK AND WROTE PAST THE END OF THE
+C   COMMON BLOCK, ONTO NNHCO ITSELF.
+C
+  175 WRITE(6,'(A)')' THIS SYSTEM CONTAINS MORE THAN 60 -HNCO- GROUPS.'
+      WRITE(6,'(A)')' THE MOLECULAR MECHANICS CORRECTION HOLDS NO MORE'
+      STOP
+  225 CONTINUE
       IF(MODE.NE.1.AND.NNHCO.NE.0)THEN
